LK-47 1.0

The neural network built into LK-47 1.0 was trained on data obtained from the
database "test80-bt4-relabel" (https://huggingface.co/datasets/xushawn/test80-bt4-relabel),
file test80-2024-02-feb-2tb7p.min-v2.v6.relabel.binpack. Its README describes the
data as relabeled with the evaluation of the Leela Chess Zero network BT4-tf13tune.

